accepted accepted accepted
defs out <p>[&lt;x&gt;]</p>
out after script <script>var x = 1;</script>&lt;b&gt;
out attr <a title="&#34; onmouseover=alert(1)">x</a>
out attr single <a title='&#39; onmouseover=alert(1)'>x</a>
out attr unquoted <a title=x>x</a>
out builtin html <p>&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;</p>
out builtin js <p>\u003C/script\u003E</p>
out builtin urlquery <p>a+b%26c</p>
out href data <a href="#ZgotmplZ">x</a>
out href js <a href="#ZgotmplZ">x</a>
out href js mixed <a href="#ZgotmplZ">x</a>
out href mailto <a href="mailto:a@b.c">x</a>
out href relative <a href="/path?q=1&amp;r=2">x</a>
out href safe <a href="https://example.com/?a=b&amp;c=d">x</a>
out js <script>var x = "\u003C/script\u003E\u003Cscript\u003Ealert(1)\u003C/script\u003E";</script>
out js quote <script>var x = 'a\u0027b\c';</script>
out src <img src="x&#34; onerror=&#34;alert(1)">
out text <p>&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;</p>
out text amp <p>a &amp; b &lt; c &gt; d &#34;e&#34; &#39;f&#39;</p>
out unquoted href <a href=#ZgotmplZ>x</a>
refused <!-- {{.}} --> stencil: an action inside an HTML comment is not supported
refused <a onclick="{{.}}">x</a> stencil: the onclick attribute is not supported
refused <p class=" stencil: bad: the template ends inside an HTML context
refused <style>{{.}}</style> stencil: <style> is not supported
refused <title>{{.}}</title> stencil: <title> is not supported
refused <{{.}}> stencil: an action as a tag name is not supported
refused {{if .}}<p{{end}}> stencil: an if block crosses an HTML context boundary
refused {{if .}}{{else}}<p{{end}} stencil: an if block crosses an HTML context boundary
refused {{range .}}<p{{end}} stencil: a range block crosses an HTML context boundary
